WEBVTT

00:25.741 --> 00:30.078
FOOL NIGHT

02:06.049 --> 02:09.719
Shoot it, Akira… Please, shoot it!

02:09.803 --> 02:12.222
Damn it, why…

02:12.305 --> 02:13.723
Why now?

02:13.807 --> 02:16.226
Come on, now's our chance!

02:16.309 --> 02:17.978
Pull the trigger!

02:18.645 --> 02:19.563
You guards, too!

02:22.190 --> 02:23.733
Shoot it!

02:35.537 --> 02:36.454
Yomiko…

02:38.039 --> 02:41.001
I'm still as lacking as ever…

02:44.963 --> 02:46.381
<i>Why won't it kill me?</i>

02:51.011 --> 02:51.928
<i>I can't hear it.</i>

02:54.681 --> 02:57.100
Come on, vines! Now's your time!

02:57.183 --> 02:58.018
Vines!

02:59.519 --> 03:00.353
Crap!

03:04.190 --> 03:05.442
If they won't come out…

03:19.915 --> 03:23.001
Why aren't you killing me?

03:24.502 --> 03:25.837
Why target Yomiko?

03:27.005 --> 03:29.466
Are you listening? Answer me!

03:41.895 --> 03:43.021
<i>That woman…</i>

03:43.104 --> 03:44.981
<i>She took my little sister.</i>

03:46.066 --> 03:47.359
Opening the hidden room.

04:03.500 --> 04:06.419
REINA

04:06.503 --> 04:09.172
KENTA

04:09.256 --> 04:12.175
AIKA

04:12.759 --> 04:13.927
Is this…

04:14.010 --> 04:17.097
Human-sourced furniture.
Probably illegal ones.

04:18.265 --> 04:21.685
SHIIKA

04:23.353 --> 04:25.814
<i>My little sister</i>
<i>was selected for the Parade.</i>

04:25.897 --> 04:29.234
<i>That woman was the only one</i>
<i>who could've stopped the Parade.</i>

04:30.110 --> 04:34.197
<i>She knew everything,</i>
<i>but still transflorated Shiika anyway!</i>

04:39.411 --> 04:40.245
<i>You're the only one</i>

04:41.705 --> 04:43.081
<i>I've been able to talk to.</i>

04:46.167 --> 04:49.838
<i>The way it's talking…</i>
<i>And the size of its skull…</i>

04:51.006 --> 04:52.340
<i>This thing…</i>

04:52.924 --> 04:53.758
<i>is a child!</i>

04:55.802 --> 04:58.179
<i>That lady. Where is she?</i>

04:59.597 --> 05:01.975
You're blaming her for something
that's not her fault!

05:02.642 --> 05:06.604
I dunno what this "parade" stuff is about,
but Yomiko's only doing her job.

05:07.355 --> 05:09.107
There's no reason to stab her!

05:09.691 --> 05:12.193
Why Yomiko, of all people?

05:13.278 --> 05:15.613
What if Yomiko never smiles again?!

05:16.531 --> 05:18.908
<i>My little sister can't smile either.</i>

05:18.992 --> 05:20.076
<i>All because of her.</i>

05:20.952 --> 05:24.873
<i>There's nothing good about being alive.</i>

05:28.209 --> 05:30.295
<i>I was born in the freezing cold.</i>

05:30.378 --> 05:32.130
<i>We didn't even have a school.</i>

05:32.839 --> 05:34.883
<i>I don't even know</i>
<i>what if feels like to be full.</i>

05:35.884 --> 05:38.553
<i>All day long, I was forced</i>
<i>to look after dying people.</i>

05:40.930 --> 05:43.141
<i>Why'd it have to be me?</i>

05:46.352 --> 05:49.189
<i>That's why everyone</i>
<i>should suffer the same.</i>

06:15.507 --> 06:16.716
What the…?!

06:18.009 --> 06:18.843
What is that?

06:20.261 --> 06:22.430
<i>I have to put out this fire…</i>

06:29.145 --> 06:30.230
<i>Why…</i>

06:31.648 --> 06:32.482
<i>I can't put it out…</i>

06:53.962 --> 06:55.755
<i>After I'd finally broken free.</i>

06:56.673 --> 07:00.093
<i>After I finally couldn't</i>
<i>feel the cold anymore.</i>

07:03.263 --> 07:04.097
<i>After I finally…</i>

07:05.098 --> 07:06.933
<i>found someone else like me.</i>

07:10.645 --> 07:14.065
<i>Thank you for listening</i>
<i>to what I had to say.</i>

07:19.529 --> 07:21.573
<i>Today at 8:18 p.m.,</i>

07:21.656 --> 07:23.783
<i>an unidentified creature</i>
<i>engulfed in flames</i>

07:23.867 --> 07:26.453
<i>appeared on Fifth Street in Spora Square.</i>

07:26.536 --> 07:31.499
<i>It attacked nearby pedestrians,</i>
<i>severely injuring eight and killing 31.</i>

07:33.042 --> 07:35.295
<i>Experts believe this creature was likely</i>

07:35.378 --> 07:38.798
<i>a transfloration patient</i>
<i>in late-stage progression…</i>

07:42.886 --> 07:47.557
By the way, Yomiko, that TV show
you told me about was hilarious.

07:47.640 --> 07:48.600
Especially when…

07:51.186 --> 07:53.563
Your Western-style hamburger steak meal.

07:54.230 --> 07:56.733
Can I get you anything else?

07:56.816 --> 07:57.817
That's all.

08:02.405 --> 08:03.323
What's wrong?

08:03.990 --> 08:05.575
Don't mind me. Just eat.

08:10.038 --> 08:13.208
Yomiko…

08:20.089 --> 08:21.216
I'm right here.

08:35.188 --> 08:38.608
You reduced a valuable
research specimen to ash!

08:39.192 --> 08:40.443
For fuck's sake!

08:40.527 --> 08:43.530
Hey! This is a hospital.
Don't make a scene.

08:43.613 --> 08:45.782
Wake up, you little shit!

08:45.865 --> 08:46.866
Calm down.

08:47.742 --> 08:48.618
You little…

08:51.204 --> 08:54.082
Unless you want to get hurt,
please run along home.

08:56.626 --> 08:59.254
They brought me so many!

08:59.337 --> 09:00.922
It was a lot, huh?

09:01.005 --> 09:03.091
I'm so grateful.

09:07.220 --> 09:08.096
Here, cocoa.

09:08.846 --> 09:09.931
Thanks.

09:15.770 --> 09:18.022
How's your stomach doing?

09:18.856 --> 09:20.567
Totally fine!

09:21.150 --> 09:26.239
They said I can't eat as much as before,
but I can still have oily and solid foods.

09:26.322 --> 09:28.449
Until then,
I'll just be sipping soup, though.

09:29.742 --> 09:32.412
That's good… That's good.

09:34.622 --> 09:35.957
You're crying again?

09:36.040 --> 09:38.710
<i>Since the recent</i>
<i>late-stage transfloration murders,</i>

09:39.377 --> 09:41.462
<i>all of the victims' bodies</i>
<i>have been identified.</i>

09:42.297 --> 09:46.634
<i>The names of those who lost their lives</i>
<i>are now being shown on screen.</i>

09:48.386 --> 09:50.555
<i>We offer our deepest condolences.</i>

09:51.431 --> 09:53.600
Well, I'm off to get a checkup.

09:54.684 --> 09:55.643
Oh, okay.

09:59.147 --> 10:01.566
<i>The flames engulfing the murder scene…</i>

10:01.649 --> 10:04.068
<i>There weren't any children</i>
<i>listed among the dead.</i>

10:05.653 --> 10:08.323
<i>And they never found</i>
<i>a child-sized skull, either.</i>

10:08.906 --> 10:13.328
<i>Furthermore, identifying the murderer</i>
<i>has proved difficult.</i>

10:14.287 --> 10:19.667
<i>The National Police are investigating</i>
<i>this incident at the bustling Spora Square</i>

10:20.335 --> 10:23.087
<i>suspecting a connection</i>
<i>to the ongoing serial murders…</i>

10:23.171 --> 10:24.839
Ivy isn't dead yet.

10:33.931 --> 10:35.350
Hey, you're awake.

10:35.975 --> 10:38.227
Good morning, sunshine.

10:45.902 --> 10:46.778
Yeah.

10:49.697 --> 10:52.992
I'm truly disgusted.
You guys are the worst.

10:53.785 --> 10:54.702
Especially you!

10:55.328 --> 11:00.416
Rather than stealing our guns,
you should've let our forces handle it.

11:00.500 --> 11:02.418
We could've avoided all this damage!

11:03.002 --> 11:05.630
You're pinning all the blame on us?

11:05.713 --> 11:09.175
You police are responsible for making
incendiary ammo in the first place--

11:09.258 --> 11:11.969
Regardless, he needs to be punished.

11:12.053 --> 11:13.763
Wait a minute.

11:13.846 --> 11:16.349
Without that gun, I would've died.

11:16.432 --> 11:18.935
And the Ivy murders would've continued--

11:19.018 --> 11:21.437
The negatives outweigh the positives here!

11:21.521 --> 11:25.066
If the ends justified the means,
we wouldn't need cops.

11:25.149 --> 11:27.360
We didn't need your help anyway.

11:27.443 --> 11:28.277
What?!

11:28.361 --> 11:32.407
Who do you think picks up the slack
when Transflora Medical screws up?

11:32.490 --> 11:36.411
Do you have any idea
how much tragedy you're causing?

11:36.494 --> 11:37.829
Get your act together!

11:38.413 --> 11:39.622
You're under arrest!

11:39.705 --> 11:42.917
For theft, hindering police activity,
and violation of firearm laws.

11:43.000 --> 11:45.420
That adds up to three years in prison!

11:46.462 --> 11:47.296
Three years?

11:47.880 --> 11:49.549
Wait, please.

11:49.632 --> 11:52.051
Anything but that, I'm begging you.

11:52.135 --> 11:56.180
Toshiro underwent transfloration.
He doesn't even have two years left!

11:56.264 --> 11:57.098
Like I care--

11:57.181 --> 12:02.812
Actually, I think they deserve credit
for successfully defeating Ivy.

12:02.895 --> 12:04.439
Ms. Himejima…

12:04.522 --> 12:07.066
I think a one-year suspension
would suffice.

12:13.114 --> 12:14.824
I'll take responsibility too.

12:15.533 --> 12:18.077
How about six months for both of us?

12:18.661 --> 12:22.457
I'm to blame as well!
Split three ways, that's four months each…

12:23.791 --> 12:26.210
Split four ways, that's three months each.

12:27.170 --> 12:30.756
Add me, and that's 365 divided by 5.

12:30.840 --> 12:33.968
So… 73 days each.

12:34.051 --> 12:35.720
You don't even work for us.

12:35.803 --> 12:37.513
What kind of nonsense is that?

12:42.018 --> 12:42.935
Fine by me.

12:43.561 --> 12:47.732
Ivy's dead. As chief of this case,
I couldn't ask for anything more.

12:48.608 --> 12:50.234
Let's compromise with a pay cut.

12:53.821 --> 12:56.115
They need to be punished.

12:56.199 --> 12:58.284
You're judging based on emotion.

12:59.327 --> 13:02.538
Bad favor with the higher-ups
won't earn you any promotions.

13:03.206 --> 13:04.832
I don't care.

13:04.916 --> 13:08.294
I'm nothing more than a cog
in their machine to begin with.

13:09.837 --> 13:14.008
Toshiro, take three months
and deeply reflect on your actions.

13:24.393 --> 13:25.353
What?

13:25.436 --> 13:29.315
Nothing, just wondering
why you defended me back there…

13:29.398 --> 13:30.566
What other choice did I have?

13:32.818 --> 13:34.779
With you around,
I'll never get my promotion.

13:38.533 --> 13:39.408
Right this way.

13:48.292 --> 13:50.294
That day, on those stairs…

13:51.963 --> 13:53.172
Ivy's victims.

13:57.885 --> 13:59.220
Don't let it faze you.

13:59.303 --> 14:01.889
It's just one of the many tragedies
we're bound to face.

14:13.192 --> 14:15.194
Who wants to play?

14:19.699 --> 14:21.659
Why are we playing a board game?

14:21.742 --> 14:22.577
I dunno.

14:24.829 --> 14:27.039
One, two, three, four.

14:27.874 --> 14:31.544
"You create a new fish species
through genetic modification.

14:31.627 --> 14:35.298
You solved world hunger. Collect $30,000."

14:35.882 --> 14:40.177
Only $30,000
for ending world hunger? Sucks for you.

14:40.261 --> 14:41.804
Talk about getting shortchanged.

14:42.388 --> 14:44.015
Here's your $30,000.

14:44.682 --> 14:46.309
You get a lucky card, too.

14:47.018 --> 14:48.144
What's this all about?

14:48.644 --> 14:51.564
You'll be bored
until you're discharged, right?

14:51.647 --> 14:54.567
Let's cheer up
and forget those pay cuts and suspensions.

14:54.650 --> 14:57.403
What are we,
dogs licking each other's wounds?

14:57.486 --> 14:59.822
Just hurry up and spin, please.

15:05.286 --> 15:06.829
BUY PROPERTY ON THE MOON
PAY $500,000

15:08.915 --> 15:11.208
On the moon? But why? That's so stupid!

15:15.463 --> 15:16.839
That's so lame.

15:16.923 --> 15:19.592
You're the biggest loser here.

15:20.176 --> 15:24.096
Clearly you're all forgetting
that I'm the Deputy Chief here.

15:45.952 --> 15:48.245
Get a six! Or even a two.
You'll lose 100,000!

15:48.329 --> 15:54.043
Eight! Come on, gimme an eight…
If I don't land on the stocks, I'll lose!

15:54.126 --> 15:55.962
Sorry to interrupt your fun.

15:56.629 --> 16:00.841
Yomiko Horai,
I need to question you about the case.

16:01.759 --> 16:02.593
Okay.

16:02.677 --> 16:03.511
This way.

16:11.978 --> 16:14.438
Why do you think Ivy targeted you?

16:16.065 --> 16:19.568
Sorry, too many reasons to list.

16:19.652 --> 16:22.989
I looked into your personal data.

16:23.072 --> 16:25.574
Looks like you
come from a respectable family.

16:25.658 --> 16:28.035
Though I see
you also had a rebellious phase.

16:29.912 --> 16:31.580
More importantly, four years ago.

16:31.664 --> 16:36.585
Shortly after joining Transflora Medical,
you handled the procedure on Shiika Izumi.

16:38.671 --> 16:41.298
She's a victim
of the human-sourced furniture trade.

16:41.382 --> 16:43.509
After transfloration,
she was crafted into furniture

16:43.592 --> 16:45.803
and became part of
some wealthy person's collection.

16:45.886 --> 16:49.098
The mediating party
made a fortune from this.

16:49.181 --> 16:54.103
She's related to Ivy by blood,
or someone close to him.

16:54.687 --> 16:55.521
Look familiar?

16:56.897 --> 16:59.191
Yes. I remember her.

17:00.026 --> 17:02.028
Okay, that'll be all.

17:08.534 --> 17:09.368
Um…

17:10.995 --> 17:14.206
What's going to happen
to her… I mean, the furniture?

17:15.624 --> 17:19.545
They haven't found it.
It vanished after Ivy stole it.

17:21.213 --> 17:22.131
It did?

17:28.304 --> 17:30.848
What gives you the right
to sulk about this?

17:36.896 --> 17:38.814
Good for you! Take care.

17:38.898 --> 17:40.691
Thanks for everything.

17:43.778 --> 17:45.196
To Transflora Medical No. 4.

17:57.792 --> 17:58.667
Ma'am.

17:59.502 --> 18:01.754
These protests are blocking the road.

18:02.338 --> 18:04.548
All the way to Transflora Medical,
most likely.

18:05.132 --> 18:07.676
Apparently, the Transfloration Board
is even worse.

18:08.719 --> 18:09.678
Protest?

18:09.762 --> 18:11.347
Oppose transfloration!

18:11.847 --> 18:13.641
Oppose transfloration!

18:15.351 --> 18:18.145
Quit using our money
for human experiments!

18:18.229 --> 18:19.355
Give our money back!

18:20.022 --> 18:24.443
Abolish transfloration!
Get rid of oxygen tax!

18:25.653 --> 18:27.404
<i>Can I even get to work?</i>

18:28.030 --> 18:29.198
Hey, you!

18:29.281 --> 18:31.200
Do you work for Transflora Medical?

18:31.283 --> 18:32.368
No, I'm…

18:32.451 --> 18:35.871
You bastards are making
all these people miserable.

18:36.664 --> 18:39.375
How do you live with yourself, huh?

18:39.458 --> 18:40.835
Say something!

18:43.462 --> 18:44.380
Damn it all…

18:53.347 --> 18:55.766
To hell with transfloration!

18:55.850 --> 18:57.643
Wreck everything!

19:00.187 --> 19:02.231
This way! Come on, Meg--

19:03.190 --> 19:04.483
Watch out! Hurry!

19:05.192 --> 19:06.068
Dad…

19:13.325 --> 19:14.368
Damn it…

19:15.119 --> 19:16.120
Meg!

19:17.872 --> 19:19.290
Meg!

19:20.624 --> 19:25.129
All further rioting
will be dealt with by force!

19:25.212 --> 19:27.506
This protest is over!
This protest is over!

19:30.885 --> 19:31.802
Fuck you guys!

19:33.012 --> 19:34.138
We're not fools!

19:36.682 --> 19:37.808
Damn it!

19:38.642 --> 19:43.189
<i>Today, several urban areas</i>
<i>saw large-scale protesting.</i>

19:43.981 --> 19:46.192
<i>It's all their fault!</i>
<i>Blame the Transfloration Board!</i>

19:47.193 --> 19:50.446
<i>They're pumping out monsters!</i>
<i>Don't you get it?</i>

19:54.158 --> 19:57.745
<i>There's nothing good about being alive.</i>

19:59.663 --> 20:01.290
<i>Following recent murders…</i>

20:01.373 --> 20:03.167
Hey, eyes on the page.

20:03.250 --> 20:04.585
Right…

20:05.169 --> 20:07.254
<i>According to the Transfloration Board,</i>

20:07.338 --> 20:11.091
<i>there are no records of the mass murderer</i>
<i>undergoing their procedure.</i>

20:11.175 --> 20:13.260
1. RELATION BETWEEN
MUKURU & SHIIKA IZUMI

20:13.344 --> 20:16.597
Well, are these case records accurate?

20:17.181 --> 20:20.059
If so, I'll go ahead
and present these to my aunt.

20:20.142 --> 20:21.018
Yeah.

20:23.520 --> 20:25.481
What a nuisance.

20:25.564 --> 20:27.733
We're not even the ones who planted Ivy.

20:30.402 --> 20:31.237
Look.

20:31.320 --> 20:32.988
2. THE TRUTH ABOUT IVY

20:33.697 --> 20:35.491
<i>Uncaria rhynchophylla…</i>

20:35.574 --> 20:37.409
A plant from the <i>Rubiaceae </i>family.

20:37.493 --> 20:40.746
They grow by extending their vines
and hooking onto things.

20:41.330 --> 20:47.253
Overseas, it's even considered a danger
for hindering the growth of other plants.

20:48.087 --> 20:51.257
We don't carry seeds
for bothersome plants like that.

20:52.091 --> 20:54.760
Transflora Medical
isn't responsible for planting Ivy.

20:57.179 --> 21:00.766
But it's because this girl
was forced into transfloration that…

21:01.809 --> 21:04.520
Are you saying that's all Horai's fault?

21:05.354 --> 21:06.605
That's not what I meant.

21:07.398 --> 21:09.984
Yomiko was just doing her job…

21:11.694 --> 21:14.321
<i>I mean, what else was she supposed to do?</i>

21:15.739 --> 21:17.783
<i>My little sister</i>
<i>was selected for the Parade.</i>

21:18.367 --> 21:21.328
<i>That woman was the only one</i>
<i>who could've stopped the Parade.</i>

21:22.871 --> 21:25.666
Akira, do you know what the "parade" is?

21:25.749 --> 21:28.544
Yeah. You're talking
about Paupertown, right?

21:28.627 --> 21:32.381
So, what's it like? Or rather, what even…

21:32.464 --> 21:33.799
You heard from Ivy, right?

21:36.427 --> 21:37.344
I knew it.

21:38.470 --> 21:40.806
You can talk to Spiriflora, can't you?

21:42.599 --> 21:46.562
So? What are you going to do
after learning about the Parade?

21:48.397 --> 21:51.650
I was thinking about going to Paupertown.

21:52.860 --> 21:54.069
I'll go with you.

21:54.153 --> 21:56.322
I have questions
I want to ask there anyway.

21:57.072 --> 21:57.990
We'll go tomorrow.

21:59.450 --> 22:00.284
Tomorrow?

22:11.587 --> 22:13.589
What took you so long?

22:13.672 --> 22:14.506
Sorry.

22:22.931 --> 22:24.850
KAORI KAMIYA

23:51.311 --> 23:56.316
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
